      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔷 M → Model (DATA layer)\n\nRepresents data that your application uses.\n\n✔ Database entities (e.g., Student, User)\n✔ DTOs\n✔ Objects sent to the view\n✔ Business objects\n\n➡ In plain words:\n\nModel = the data you want to show or process.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔷 M → Model (DATA layer)\n\nRepresents data that your application uses.\n\n✔ Database entities (e.g., Student, User)\n✔ DTOs\n✔ Objects sent to the view\n✔ Business objects\n\n➡ In plain words:\n\nModel = the data you want to show or process.",
