      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔷 V → View (UI layer)\n\nWhat the user SEES.\n\nIn Java-based web apps, view can be:\n\n✔ JSP (old style)\n✔ Thymeleaf (Spring templates)\n✔ HTML files\n✔ React/Angular (front-end SPA)\n\n➡ The view displays data from the model.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔷 V → View (UI layer)\n\nWhat the user SEES.\n\nIn Java-based web apps, view can be:\n\n✔ JSP (old style)\n✔ Thymeleaf (Spring templates)\n✔ HTML files\n✔ React/Angular (front-end SPA)\n\n➡ The view displays data from the model.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
