      "text": "🟩 2. What is Spring Boot Web?\n\nSpring Boot Web is a framework to quickly build web applications using:\n\n✔ Embedded Tomcat\n\nYou don’t install Tomcat separately.\nThe server starts automatically inside the app.\n\n✔ Spring MVC\n\nProvides controllers, request mappings, data binding.\n\n✔ Auto Configuration\n\nNo need to configure servlet, web.xml, server manually.\n\n✔ Starters\n\nYou add this:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟩 2. What is Spring Boot Web?\n\nSpring Boot Web is a framework to quickly build web applications using:\n\n✔ Embedded Tomcat\n\nYou don’t install Tomcat separately.\nThe server starts automatically inside the app.\n\n✔ Spring MVC\n\nProvides controllers, request mappings, data binding.\n\n✔ Auto Configuration\n\nNo need to configure servlet, web.xml, server manually.\n\n✔ Starters\n\nYou add this:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
