      "updated": 1764350177866,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's explore the model(M) layer a bit More:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's explore the model(M) layer a bit More:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NN-8VniPMtPCjyFwENn2v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 366.2414284951674,
      "y": 8019.9077461895995,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323438898,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 165814958,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764350183602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔷 M → Model (DATA layer)\n\nRepresents data that your application uses.\n\n✔ Database entities (e.g., Student, User)\n✔ DTOs\n✔ Objects sent to the view\n✔ Business objects\n\n➡ In plain words:\n\nModel = the data you want to show or process.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔷 M → Model (DATA layer)\n\nRepresents data that your application uses.\n\n✔ Database entities (e.g., Student, User)\n✔ DTOs\n✔ Objects sent to the view\n✔ Business objects\n\n➡ In plain words:\n\nModel = the data you want to show or process.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xjGF6frZJJZhj3nEfHqE8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 374.7676677298725,
      "y": 8386.35298286222,
      "width": 726,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1384107822,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 275078190,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764350271681,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now technically when we talk about model in mvc here model is not\nthe table scheama or document schema -model is the data that needs\nto be processed by view technology\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now technically when we talk about model in mvc here model is not\nthe table scheama or document schema -model is the data that needs\nto be processed by view technology\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
