      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY “MODEL” IN MVC IS NOT DATABASE MODEL (IMPORTANT CONCEPT)\n\nMany beginners get confused because:\n\n✔ We call database entity classes = Model\n✔ MVC also has something called Model\n\nBut they are NOT the same.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY “MODEL” IN MVC IS NOT DATABASE MODEL (IMPORTANT CONCEPT)\n\nMany beginners get confused because:\n\n✔ We call database entity classes = Model\n✔ MVC also has something called Model\n\nBut they are NOT the same.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
