      "index": "bYG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1796136238,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 208072302,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764350429089,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ 1. In MVC (Spring MVC + JSP)\n\nModel = data you want to display on the view.\n\nExamples:\n\n1.Strings\n\n2.Integers\n\n3.Lists\n\n4.Java Objects (DTOs)\n\n5.Actual database entities\n\nYou send this data to JSP using:\n\n  model.addAttribute(\"students\", list);\n\nThis is purely for the view.\n\n💡 It has nothing to do with the database layer.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ 1. In MVC (Spring MVC + JSP)\n\nModel = data you want to display on the view.\n\nExamples:\n\n1.Strings\n\n2.Integers\n\n3.Lists\n\n4.Java Objects (DTOs)\n\n5.Actual database entities\n\nYou send this data to JSP using:\n\n  model.addAttribute(\"students\", list);\n\nThis is purely for the view.\n\n💡 It has nothing to do with the database layer.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
