      "updated": 1764350506868,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ 2. In Database Layer (JPA / Hibernate)\n\n\"Model\" usually refers to:\n\n@Entity\n\nRepresents a table schema\n\nMaps columns → Java fields\n\nExample:\n\n@Entity\npublic class Student {\n    @Id\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n}\n\nThis is Database Model, not MVC model.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ 2. In Database Layer (JPA / Hibernate)\n\n\"Model\" usually refers to:\n\n@Entity\n\nRepresents a table schema\n\nMaps columns → Java fields\n\nExample:\n\n@Entity\npublic class Student {\n    @Id\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n}\n\nThis is Database Model, not MVC model.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
