      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764350659482,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ Meaning 1: Model (Database Entity / Schema)\n\nUsed in: Spring Data JPA / Hibernate / ORM\n\nExample:\n\n@Entity\npublic class Student {\n    @Id\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n}\n\n\nHere Model = Database Table Mapping\nIt represents:\n\n-DB table\n\n-Columns\n\n-Primary key\n\n-Relationships\n\nThis is domain model / entity model.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ Meaning 1: Model (Database Entity / Schema)\n\nUsed in: Spring Data JPA / Hibernate / ORM\n\nExample:\n\n@Entity\npublic class Student {\n    @Id\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n}\n\n\nHere Model = Database Table Mapping\nIt represents:\n\n-DB table\n\n-Columns\n\n-Primary key\n\n-Relationships\n\nThis is domain model / entity model.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
