    {
      "id": "yP8s7DZVjMnqYhhYfh3El",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 358.90330171995186,
      "y": 12709.745067846554,
      "width": 715,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1511400562,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 1198742702,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764350708348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ Meaning 2: Model (Data Carrier for View — in Spring MVC)\n\nUsed in: Spring Boot Web (JSP/Thymeleaf)\n\nExample:\n\n@GetMapping(\"/greet\")\npublic String greet(Model model) {\n    model.addAttribute(\"name\", \"Shiv\");\n    return \"hello\";   // hello.jsp\n}\n\n\nHere Model has NOTHING to do with database.\n\nHere Model = A temporary map used to send data to JSP page.\n\nEquivalent to:\n\nrequest.setAttribute(\"name\", \"Shiv\");\nforward to JSP\n\n\nSpring MVC replaces this request attribute passing with a cleaner\nModel object.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ Meaning 2: Model (Data Carrier for View — in Spring MVC)\n\nUsed in: Spring Boot Web (JSP/Thymeleaf)\n\nExample:\n\n@GetMapping(\"/greet\")\npublic String greet(Model model) {\n    model.addAttribute(\"name\", \"Shiv\");\n    return \"hello\";   // hello.jsp\n}\n\n\nHere Model has NOTHING to do with database.\n\nHere Model = A temporary map used to send data to JSP page.\n\nEquivalent to:\n\nrequest.setAttribute(\"name\", \"Shiv\");\nforward to JSP\n\n\nSpring MVC replaces this request attribute passing with a cleaner Model object.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
