      "updated": 1764351190061,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟧 4. Real Explanation With Analogy\nSuppose your DB stores:\nStudent(id=1, name=\"Shiv\", age=20)\n\nController:\nStudent s = repo.findById(1);\nmodel.addAttribute(\"stud\", s);\nreturn \"profile.jsp\";\n\nFlow:\nDB → Entity/Model Object → Controller → Model → JSP\n\n\n📌 Entity (DB model) → actual table row\n📌 Model (Spring MVC model) → temporary data carrier for\nrendering",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟧 4. Real Explanation With Analogy\nSuppose your DB stores:\nStudent(id=1, name=\"Shiv\", age=20)\n\nController:\nStudent s = repo.findById(1);\nmodel.addAttribute(\"stud\", s);\nreturn \"profile.jsp\";\n\nFlow:\nDB → Entity/Model Object → Controller → Model → JSP\n\n\n📌 Entity (DB model) → actual table row\n📌 Model (Spring MVC model) → temporary data carrier for rendering",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
