      "text": "3.Now let's create a jsp page -in order to create a jsp page \nit's important for us to create in src->main->webapp folder \nso that our server can read our jsp page \n\nJSP (Java Server Pages): A technology that allows embedding Java code into \nHTML for dynamic web content.",
