      "text": "Now the question is why do we need as jsp parser ?\nthe thing is tomcat server does not know how to read jsp\nso what jsp parser does it converts jsp into a servlet class\nwhich takes the incomming request and outputs the html",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now the question is why do we need as jsp parser ?\nthe thing is tomcat server does not know how to read jsp\nso what jsp parser does it converts jsp into a servlet class\nwhich takes the incomming request and outputs the html",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
