      "updated": 1764395893520,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟦 9. Why JSP & Servlet work together (MVC)\n✔ Servlet (Controller)\n\nHandles logic\nTakes input\nSends data to JSP\n\n✔ JSP (View)\n\nShows data\nGenerates HTML\n\nExample flow:\n\nUser → Servlet → Fetch DB → Send data to JSP → JSP displays",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟦 9. Why JSP & Servlet work together (MVC)\n✔ Servlet (Controller)\n\nHandles logic\nTakes input\nSends data to JSP\n\n✔ JSP (View)\n\nShows data\nGenerates HTML\n\nExample flow:\n\nUser → Servlet → Fetch DB → Send data to JSP → JSP displays",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
