      "seed": 73240238,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1719839342,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764399122222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 5. Real Explanation (the most logical one)\n🤔 Question:\n\nIf servlet already handles request & response, why use JSP?\n\n✔ Because JSP gives the View (UI).\n✔ Servlet gives the Controller (logic).\n\nSo the workflow becomes MVC:\n\nClient → Servlet → Fetch data → Pass data to JSP → JSP displays\nHTML\n\nSERVLET = Thinker\nJSP = Shower (UI)\n\nSo we need both.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 5. Real Explanation (the most logical one)\n🤔 Question:\n\nIf servlet already handles request & response, why use JSP?\n\n✔ Because JSP gives the View (UI).\n✔ Servlet gives the Controller (logic).\n\nSo the workflow becomes MVC:\n\nClient → Servlet → Fetch data → Pass data to JSP → JSP displays HTML\n\nSERVLET = Thinker\nJSP = Shower (UI)\n\nSo we need both.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
