      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1286207794,
      "version": 140,
      "versionNonce": 622648882,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764400749044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's create that controller and see the methods through which we can \ntake / fetch data from client request",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's create that controller and see the methods through which we can \ntake / fetch data from client request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yYp4alFQ8aj3lzF3ctCke",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -48.51460173812177,
      "y": 41826.48601313462,
      "width": 703.99609375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bb9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1741075054,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 501155374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764400764824,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Accepting Data the Servlet Way\n \nHttpServletRequest: \n● getParameter(\"name\"): Retrieves form data sent in the request.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Accepting Data the Servlet Way\n \nHttpServletRequest: \n● getParameter(\"name\"): Retrieves form data sent in the request.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rSNpufvayTTsAAMa4l4zF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -38.827152142762316,
      "y": 41958.68711359652,
      "width": 676.6015625,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 520386354,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 1115479474,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764400816825,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steps: \n1. Create an add() method inside HomeController. \n2. Create result.jsp page \n\n3. Add mapping (@RequestMapping(“add”)) \n\n@RequestMapping(\"add\") \npublic String add(){ \nreturn \"result.jsp\"; \n} \n\n4. We need the Dispatcher Servlet to map requests.  \n5. We need to accept value inside the add() method. \n⇨ Using the HttpServletRequest object, we can get the value. \n⇨ int num1 = Integer.parseInt(req.getParameter(“num1”)); \n⇨ int num2 = Integer.parseInt(req.getParameter(“num2”));",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps: \n1. Create an add() method inside HomeController. \n2. Create result.jsp page \n\n3. Add mapping (@RequestMapping(“add”)) \n\n@RequestMapping(\"add\") \npublic String add(){ \nreturn \"result.jsp\"; \n} \n\n4. We need the Dispatcher Servlet to map requests.  \n5. We need to accept value inside the add() method. \n⇨ Using the HttpServletRequest object, we can get the value. \n⇨ int num1 = Integer.parseInt(req.getParameter(“num1”)); \n⇨ int num2 = Integer.parseInt(req.getParameter(“num2”));",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
