      "text": "Even though Spring Boot uses @GetMapping, @PostMapping, etc., the\nwhole MVC system is still built on top of Servlets.\n\n✔ Spring MVC = Runs on top of the Servlet API\n✔ DispatcherServlet = A Servlet\n✔ Every request eventually becomes a HttpServletRequest\n\nSo yes — you can still access low-level servlet objects like:\n\n-HttpServletRequest\n\n-HttpServletResponse\n\n-HttpSession\n\n-Cookie\n\nBecause Spring Boot is built on top of the Java Servlet API.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Even though Spring Boot uses @GetMapping, @PostMapping, etc., the whole MVC system is still built on top of Servlets.\n\n✔ Spring MVC = Runs on top of the Servlet API\n✔ DispatcherServlet = A Servlet\n✔ Every request eventually becomes a HttpServletRequest\n\nSo yes — you can still access low-level servlet objects like:\n\n-HttpServletRequest\n\n-HttpServletResponse\n\n-HttpSession\n\n-Cookie\n\nBecause Spring Boot is built on top of the Java Servlet API.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oqHzixUxyLc0mdWHgaXSe",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -88.90580416533544,
