      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764401151323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🎯 Key Concept\n👉 Spring MVC is built on top of Servlet API\n👉 Every request is ultimately:\n\nHttpServletRequest req = ...\n\nSpring just gives you a nicer API on top of it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🎯 Key Concept\n👉 Spring MVC is built on top of Servlet API\n👉 Every request is ultimately:\n\nHttpServletRequest req = ...\n\nSpring just gives you a nicer API on top of it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
