      "seed": 1510066418,
      "version": 25,
      "versionNonce": 1164945138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764401192866,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟦 When you SHOULD use HttpServletRequest in Spring Boot\n\nUse it when you need:\n\n✔ Raw HTTP details\n\n-Headers\n\n-IP address\n\n-Cookies\n\n-User-agent\n\n-Session data\n\n✔ Access low-level details\nreq.getHeader(\"User-Agent\");\nreq.getSession();\nreq.getCookies();\nreq.getRequestURL();\n\n✔ When migrating old Servlet-based projects to Spring Boot",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟦 When you SHOULD use HttpServletRequest in Spring Boot\n\nUse it when you need:\n\n✔ Raw HTTP details\n\n-Headers\n\n-IP address\n\n-Cookies\n\n-User-agent\n\n-Session data\n\n✔ Access low-level details\nreq.getHeader(\"User-Agent\");\nreq.getSession();\nreq.getCookies();\nreq.getRequestURL();\n\n✔ When migrating old Servlet-based projects to Spring Boot",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
