      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764401221847,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟥 When you should NOT use HttpServletRequest\n\nAvoid using it for simple inputs like:\n\n❌ reading num1\n❌ reading form fields\n❌ reading JSON manually\n❌ parsing request body\n\nInstead use:\n\n-@RequestParam\n\n-@PathVariable\n\n-@RequestBody\n\n-DTO classes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟥 When you should NOT use HttpServletRequest\n\nAvoid using it for simple inputs like:\n\n❌ reading num1\n❌ reading form fields\n❌ reading JSON manually\n❌ parsing request body\n\nInstead use:\n\n-@RequestParam\n\n-@PathVariable\n\n-@RequestBody\n\n-DTO classes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
