      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764401631017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 Why is this possible?\nBecause:\n\n-Spring Boot runs on Embedded Tomcat\n\n-Tomcat uses Servlet API\n\n-Spring MVC's DispatcherServlet wraps the original HttpServletRequest\n\n-Spring then passes it to controller methods when requested\n\nSo even though you are not writing a servlet:\n\ndoGet(HttpServletRequest req)\n\nSpring MVC lets you pull the request object whenever you need it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 Why is this possible?\nBecause:\n\n-Spring Boot runs on Embedded Tomcat\n\n-Tomcat uses Servlet API\n\n-Spring MVC's DispatcherServlet wraps the original HttpServletRequest\n\n-Spring then passes it to controller methods when requested\n\nSo even though you are not writing a servlet:\n\ndoGet(HttpServletRequest req)\n\nSpring MVC lets you pull the request object whenever you need it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
