      "seed": 407669874,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 1272851954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764401705758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟢 When should you use HttpServletRequest?\n\nUse it only when you need:\n\n✔ Headers\n✔ Cookies\n✔ Session\n✔ Remote IP\n✔ Request URL\n✔ Low-level HTTP details\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/info\")\n    public String info(HttpServletRequest req) {\n        return req.getHeader(\"User-Agent\");\n    }\n\n🔴 When NOT to use HttpServletRequest?\n\nAvoid it for reading form or query values:\n\n❌ req.getParameter(\"name\")\n✔ use @RequestParam String name\n\nAvoid it for JSON:\n\n❌ reading raw JSON from body\n✔ use @RequestBody StudentDTO dto",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟢 When should you use HttpServletRequest?\n\nUse it only when you need:\n\n✔ Headers\n✔ Cookies\n✔ Session\n✔ Remote IP\n✔ Request URL\n✔ Low-level HTTP details\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/info\")\n    public String info(HttpServletRequest req) {\n        return req.getHeader(\"User-Agent\");\n    }\n\n🔴 When NOT to use HttpServletRequest?\n\nAvoid it for reading form or query values:\n\n❌ req.getParameter(\"name\")\n✔ use @RequestParam String name\n\nAvoid it for JSON:\n\n❌ reading raw JSON from body\n✔ use @RequestBody StudentDTO dto",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
