      "updated": 1764404027698,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ Model vs setAttribute()\n\n(Used in Spring MVC vs Servlets)\n\nThis is one of the most confusing topics — but after this\nexplanation, it will be 💯 clear.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ Model vs setAttribute()\n\n(Used in Spring MVC vs Servlets)\n\nThis is one of the most confusing topics — but after this explanation, it will be 💯 clear.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
