      "text": "✔ Servlet (setAttribute)\n\nIn servlet you manually do:\n\n    req.setAttribute(\"name\", \"Shiv\");\n    req.getRequestDispatcher(\"home.jsp\").forward(req, resp);\n\n\nThis is the raw way.",
      "fontSize": 20,
