      "updated": 1764409992354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Inside JSP we directly use the session object. \n<%= session.getAttribute(“result”) %> \n<%@ page language=\"java\" %> \n<html> \n<head> \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"style.css\"> \n</head> \n<body> \n</body> \n</html> \n<h2>Result is: <%= session.getAttribute(\"result\") %></h2>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Inside JSP we directly use the session object. \n<%= session.getAttribute(“result”) %> \n<%@ page language=\"java\" %> \n<html> \n<head> \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"style.css\"> \n</head> \n<body> \n</body> \n</html> \n<h2>Result is: <%= session.getAttribute(\"result\") %></h2>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
