      "text": "Now for the last part we are going to look at ModelAndView with \nModelAttribute",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now for the last part we are going to look at ModelAndView with \nModelAttribute",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Gw87djvcBiah1XyJXvhp2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -287.43998898482505,
      "y": 70784.56363610819,
      "width": 605,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bde",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1079331506,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 98524782,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764430733257,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟩 1. What is Model in Spring MVC?\n\nModel is used only to pass data to the view (JSP/HTML).\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/home\")\n    public String home(Model model) {\n        model.addAttribute(\"msg\", \"Hello Shiv!\");\n        return \"home.jsp\";\n    }\n\n✔ Usage\n\n-Add attributes (data)\n\n-Return ONLY the view name\n\n-No control over view + model together\n\n✔ Scope\n\n-Request scope (data exists for 1 request only)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟩 1. What is Model in Spring MVC?\n\nModel is used only to pass data to the view (JSP/HTML).\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/home\")\n    public String home(Model model) {\n        model.addAttribute(\"msg\", \"Hello Shiv!\");\n        return \"home.jsp\";\n    }\n\n✔ Usage\n\n-Add attributes (data)\n\n-Return ONLY the view name\n\n-No control over view + model together\n\n✔ Scope\n\n-Request scope (data exists for 1 request only)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
