      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764430837401,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟦 2. What is ModelAndView?\n\nModelAndView is an older Spring MVC class that contains:\n\n✔ Model (data)\n✔ View name\n\nTogether in one object.\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/home\")\n    public ModelAndView home() {\n        ModelAndView mv = new ModelAndView();\n        mv.addObject(\"msg\", \"Hello Shiv!\");\n        mv.setViewName(\"home.jsp\");\n        return mv;\n    }\n\n⭐ ModelAndView = Model + View in one object.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟦 2. What is ModelAndView?\n\nModelAndView is an older Spring MVC class that contains:\n\n✔ Model (data)\n✔ View name\n\nTogether in one object.\n\nExample:\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/home\")\n    public ModelAndView home() {\n        ModelAndView mv = new ModelAndView();\n        mv.addObject(\"msg\", \"Hello Shiv!\");\n        mv.setViewName(\"home.jsp\");\n        return mv;\n    }\n\n⭐ ModelAndView = Model + View in one object.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
