      "updated": 1764430969564,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟩 4. When should you use ModelAndView?\n\nUse when:\n\n✔ You want to return different views from same method\n✔ You want to group view + data in one return value\n✔ You are working in old Spring MVC style\n\nOtherwise → use Model (recommended).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟩 4. When should you use ModelAndView?\n\nUse when:\n\n✔ You want to return different views from same method\n✔ You want to group view + data in one return value\n✔ You are working in old Spring MVC style\n\nOtherwise → use Model (recommended).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
