      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟦 7. Difference Between @RequestParam vs @ModelAttribute\n@RequestParam:-Maps single value from query/form.\n\n    @RequestParam String name\n\n\n\n@ModelAttribute:-Maps entire object from multiple request fields.\n\n    @ModelAttribute Student student",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟦 7. Difference Between @RequestParam vs @ModelAttribute\n@RequestParam:-Maps single value from query/form.\n\n    @RequestParam String name\n\n\n\n@ModelAttribute:-Maps entire object from multiple request fields.\n\n    @ModelAttribute Student student",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
